    "narrative": "The Austin Waves are positioned for a high-ceiling outing today, led by **Kyle Tucker**, who commands an elite score of 70.48. He remains our primary offensive anchor against Sproat, benefiting from a favorable platoon advantage and a prime #4 spot in the order. Joining him at the top of the hierarchy is **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (65.00), who holds steady despite a slightly tougher matchup against Keller. While the scarcity of stolen bases remains our primary tactical objective, **Gunnar Henderson** (63.79) provides the best dual-threat profile of the day; despite a neutral matchup against Valdez and a platoon disadvantage, he is bolstered by a massive 16% park factor adjustment and a unique \"Slow SP Delivery\" indicator that significantly inflates his stolen base probability.\n\nOur most complex decision centered on the utility slot, where **Coby Mayo** (53.42) just barely outpaced **Nolan Schanuel** (49.36). **Nolan Schanuel** fell just shy of the cutoff because the optimizer weighed his neutral platoon against Gore too heavily compared to the high-upside park factors favoring **Coby Mayo**. We are monitoring several \"Lineup Pending\" statuses, specifically for **Sam Antonacci** and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**; should **Sam Antonacci** shift from his projected #1 hole, his current 53.52 score could fluctuate, though his elite xwOBA and favorable wind conditions at the park provide a strong buffer against volatility. \n\nRisks today are concentrated in the bottom of our order. **Dominic Smith** is currently our most vulnerable start at 41.03; his score is dragged down by a detrimental L/L platoon matchup against Foster Griffin, leaving him strictly on the roster as a volume placeholder. Conversely, keep an eye on **Nasim Nunez** and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, both of whom carry high \"SP Skill\" bonuses due to the matchup against Mart\u00edn P\u00e9rez. Provided the confirmed lineups match our projections, we are well-positioned to maintain our efficiency targets while balancing the risk of over-exposure in unfavorable platoon splits.",
